# Harness run artifacts (Bootstrap Protocol 2026-11-03): the run directory is evidence, not source.
# The gate stamps only a clean worktree, so per-unit logs, fixtures, handoffs and reports must stay
# untracked; integrity comes from handoffHash + artifactSha256, not from committing them.
docs/specs/harness-reliability-bootstrap-20261103/*/logs/
